            "title": "Trump\u2019s Truck Tariffs Are Coming. Here\u2019s Who Wins and Loses.",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Shares of heavy-duty truck maker  Paccar  rose Friday after President Donald Trump announced new tariffs on foreign-made heavy-duty trucks on Thursday.  \u201cIn order to protect our Great Heavy Duty Truck Manufacturers from unfair outside competition, I will be imposing, as of October 1st, 2025, a 25% tariff on all Heavy (Big!) Trucks made in other parts of the World,\u201d the president said on Truth Social.  \u201cTherefore, our Great Large Truck Company Manufacturers, such as Peterbilt, Kenworth, Freightliner, Mack Trucks, and others will be protected.\u201d",
